{"type":"click","text":"A\n    \n      Fix Leaflet in place Recommended\n      Keep react-leaflet. Switch to a reliable tile provider (OpenStreetMap / Stadia). Bundle real Bihar district GeoJSON as a static file in /public so the map never depends on the backend for shapes. Add crime intensity labels, proper legend, and color scale.\n      \n        \n          ✅ Least code change\n          ✅ Works with existing data\n          ✅ Fastest to ship\n        \n        \n          ⚠ Still Leaflet limits\n          ⚠ Tiles need internet\n        \n      \n\n      \n        What you'll see: Real Bihar map with 38 district shapes coloured by FIR density (blue → orange → red). Hotspot circles with crime count labels. Risk legend bottom-left. Tabs for Cluster / Heatmap / Women safety.","choice":"leaflet-fix","id":null,"timestamp":1778392109708}
